{"4972620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Xydorth", "steam_appid": 4972620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5103440], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in your tent to find that your wife has vanished. You had planned to explore uncharted cave systems deep in the wilderness together. Now, your search for her leads you ever deeper into dark caves and bottomless chasms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xydorth is a classic first-person shooter with survival horror elements. Explore forests, caves, and catacombs as your search draws you deeper into the clutches of a mysterious cult. Before long, you can no longer tell what is real and what is fiction. Only by mastering your weapons and solving puzzles will you survive this nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972620/extras/6a75d0583b9c9f515b5756dc6e7bc0c8.avif?t=1788086657\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4972620/extras_big/6a75d0583b9c9f515b5756dc6e7bc0c8.webp?t=1788086657 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic first-person shooter with survival horror elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear world featuring forests, caves, and catacombs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action-packed firefights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense, oppressive atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: 2–4 hours</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in your tent to find that y